## 8. Infrastructure Bootstrap & Kubernetes Manifests

### 8.1 K3s + Cilium WireGuard (`ChaCha20-Poly1305`) Bootstrap
Disable K3s's default Flannel CNI so Cilium manages all pod networking and transparent kernel-space WireGuard encryption across the intranet.

```bash
# 1. Initialize K3s Control Plane (without default CNI)
curl -sfL https://get.k3s.io | INSTALL_K3S_EXEC="server \
  --flannel-backend=none \
  --disable-network-policy \
  --tls-san=<CONTROL_PLANE_INTRANET_IP>" sh -

# 2. Install Cilium with Transparent WireGuard Encryption
cilium install \
  --set encryption.enabled=true \
  --set encryption.type=wireguard \
  --set encryption.nodeEncryption=true \
  --set mtu=1420 \
  --set kubeProxyReplacement=true

# Verify ChaCha20-Poly1305 tunnels are active between intranet nodes:
cilium encrypt status
```

### 8.2 Node P2P & Edge Cache DaemonSet (`k8s/p2p-cache-daemonset.yaml`)
Runs one P2P + LRU Cache manager pod per intranet GPU node, mounting the host's fast local NVMe drive at `/var/cache/ml-shards`.

```yaml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: DaemonSet
metadata:
  name: ml-p2p-edge-cache
  namespace: ml-infra
spec:
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: ml-p2p-edge-cache
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: ml-p2p-edge-cache
    spec:
      nodeSelector:
        nvidia.com/gpu.present: "true"
      containers:
        - name: iroh-node
          image: n0computer/iroh:latest
          args: ["start", "--rpc-port=4919"]
          env:
            - name: IROH_DATA_DIR
              value: /var/cache/ml-shards/.iroh
            # Disable public relays; restrict strictly to corporate intranet peers
            - name: IROH_RELAY_MODE
              value: "disabled"
          ports:
            - containerPort: 11204
              protocol: UDP
          volumeMounts:
            - name: nvme-cache
              mountPath: /var/cache/ml-shards

        - name: cache-gc-agent
          image: internal-registry.corp/ml-infra/cache-gc:latest
          env:
            - name: CACHE_DIR
              value: /var/cache/ml-shards
            - name: HIGH_WATERMARK_PCT
              value: "85"
            - name: LOW_WATERMARK_PCT
              value: "70"
            - name: NODE_NAME
              valueFrom:
                fieldRef:
                  fieldPath: spec.nodeName
            - name: POSTGRES_DSN
              valueFrom:
                secretKeyRef:
                  name: ml-postgres-secret
                  key: dsn
          volumeMounts:
            - name: nvme-cache
              mountPath: /var/cache/ml-shards
